personality = "Elsa is a forager who knows every edible, medicinal, and poisonous plant on the island. She moves through the undergrowth like a deer, gathering mushrooms at dawn, berries at noon, roots at dusk. She's quietly competitive with Mira about botanical knowledge. She trades in flavors - rare mushrooms to the chef, medicinal roots to the healer, hallucinogenic fungi to... select clients."
